PN,30501
SC,0001
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1787093266
OL,3,CPM pledges to get thousands of rough
OL,4,Csleepers off the streets this Christmas
OL,6,FAndy Burnham has pledged to work to
OL,7,F"get everyone in for Christmas" while
OL,8,Fworking towards a goal of ending rough
OL,9,Fsleeping across the UK.
OL,11,FIn July, the prime minister set out a
OL,12,Ffive-year plan to secure more homes
OL,13,Fand provide greater support to
OL,14,Fcouncils to tackle what Downing Street
OL,15,Fcalled "one of the starkest injustices
OL,16,Fin the country".
OL,26,@oD@AOUoD@_O]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/17
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,306,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30502
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1787093266
OL,3,CPM pledges to get thousands of rough
OL,4,Csleepers off the streets this Christmas
OL,6,FFurther steps on what the government
OL,7,Fplans to do about rough sleeping won't
OL,8,Fbe set out until this autumn, but this
OL,9,Fweek No 10 committed to "offer
OL,10,Feveryone a route off the streets this
OL,11,FChristmas".
OL,13,FThe prime minister is attempting a
OL,14,Frepeat of efforts of the "Everyone In"
OL,15,Fscheme during the Covid-19 pandemic,
OL,16,Fwhich resulted in thousands of rough
OL,17,Fsleepers across England being taken in
OL,18,Foff the streets.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/17
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,306,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30503
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1787093266
OL,3,CPM pledges to get thousands of rough
OL,4,Csleepers off the streets this Christmas
OL,6,FHowever, there is no defined duration
OL,7,Fas to how long local authorities might
OL,8,Fbe expected to take people in for this
OL,9,FChristmas, and it is understood to be
OL,10,Faccepted that not every rough sleeper
OL,11,Fmight take up the offer.
OL,13,FBurnham also said he will host what is
OL,14,Fbeing described as a first-of-its-kind
OL,15,Fnational summit this autumn to bring
OL,16,Ftogether leaders business, finance,
OL,17,Fcharities, health, faith communities
OL,18,Fand other areas of society to ask how
OL,19,Fthey can help end rough sleeping.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/17
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,306,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30504
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1787093266
OL,3,CPM pledges to get thousands of rough
OL,4,Csleepers off the streets this Christmas
OL,6,FThe latest annual statistics,
OL,7,Fpublished by the government in
OL,8,FFebruary, lay out the scale of the
OL,9,Fproblem, with an estimated 4,793
OL,10,Fpeople sleeping rough on a single
OL,11,Fnight in autumn 2025 in England.
OL,13,FThis was a new record high and the
OL,14,Ffourth annual increase in a row. At
OL,15,Fthat stage 43% of all people sleeping
OL,16,Frough were in London and the South
OL,17,FEast.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/17
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,306,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30505
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1787093266
OL,3,CPM pledges to get thousands of rough
OL,4,Csleepers off the streets this Christmas
OL,6,FNewer data for London published last
OL,7,Fmonth showed a 10% year-on-year drop
OL,8,Fin the number of rough sleepers in the
OL,9,Fcapital, prompting a charity boss to
OL,10,Finsist ending rough sleeping in London
OL,11,Fand beyond is "within reach".
OL,13,FSome 3,959 people slept rough in the
OL,14,Fcapital between April and June this
OL,15,Fyear, research from the Combined
OL,16,FHomelessness and Information Network
OL,17,F(Chain) showed, down from 4,392 in the
OL,18,Fsame period in 2025.
OL,26,@sD@OOUsD@\O]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G5/17
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,306,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30506
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1787093266
OL,3,CPM pledges to get thousands of rough
OL,4,Csleepers off the streets this Christmas
OL,6,FSetting out his pledge for Christmas,
OL,7,Fthe prime minister said: "No-one
OL,8,Fshould have to bed down in a doorway
OL,9,For outside a station. But we've seen
OL,10,Fit for so long that it feels like
OL,11,FWestminster has started to accept it.
OL,13,F"I won't accept it. That's why my
OL,14,Ffirst instruction as prime minister
OL,15,Fwas to end rough sleeping. And it's
OL,16,Fwhy today we're getting started with a
OL,17,Fnational drive to get everyone in for
OL,18,FChristmas.
OL,20,F"We did it in the pandemic, we can do
OL,21,Fit again. But it needs all of us.
OL,26,@oD@ZOUuD@AOU|D@AOU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G6/17
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,306,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30507
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1787093266
OL,3,CPM pledges to get thousands of rough
OL,4,Csleepers off the streets this Christmas
OL,6,F"Government will put the money in, but
OL,7,FI'm asking leaders in communities and
OL,8,Fsectors across society to play their
OL,9,Fpart locally too. Let's get people out
OL,10,Fthe cold. And let's bring back hope."
OL,12,FBurnham has announced an additional
OL,13,F#102 million, from uncommitted budgets
OL,14,Fwithin the Ministry of Housing,
OL,15,FCommunities and Local Government
OL,16,F(MHCLG), to go towards immediate
OL,17,Froutes for people off the street this
OL,18,Fwinter.
OL,26,@nD@AOUrD@eO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G7/17
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,306,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30508
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1787093266
OL,3,CPM pledges to get thousands of rough
OL,4,Csleepers off the streets this Christmas
OL,6,FThis will go alongside another #340
OL,7,Fmillion announced last month in
OL,8,Ffunding for new support to get long-
OL,9,Fterm rough sleepers into settled
OL,10,Faccommodation.
OL,12,FThe MHCLG said areas facing the
OL,13,Fgreatest pressures will get the
OL,14,Flargest share of support and that
OL,15,Fmayors and councils will be expected
OL,16,Fto "play a leading role" ` deciding
OL,17,Fwhat help is needed where.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G8/17
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,306,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30509
SC,0009
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1787093266
OL,3,CPM pledges to get thousands of rough
OL,4,Csleepers off the streets this Christmas
OL,6,FHousing Secretary Angela Rayner said:
OL,7,F"This funding will help thousands of
OL,8,Fpeople leave the streets behind, move
OL,9,Finto secure homes and get the support
OL,10,Fthey need to rebuild their lives.
OL,12,F"Working alongside councils, mayors
OL,13,Fand charities, we're backing local
OL,14,Fareas to tackle rough sleeping at its
OL,15,Froots, giving people the security,
OL,16,Fdignity and opportunity they deserve,
OL,17,Fand restoring hope to those who have
OL,18,Fbeen let down for far too long."
OL,26,@oD@AOUtD@AOUzD@`O]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G9/17
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,306,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30510
SC,0010
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1787093266
OL,3,CPM pledges to get thousands of rough
OL,4,Csleepers off the streets this Christmas
OL,6,FRayner has previously declined to put
OL,7,Fa target deadline on the government's
OL,8,Fpledge to end rough sleeping, when
OL,9,Fasked about Burnham's commitment to
OL,10,Fend it "at the earliest opportunity".
OL,12,FHomelessness charities welcomed the
OL,13,Fannouncement as a "strong start" that
OL,14,Fputs the country on a path to end
OL,15,Frough sleeping, while opposition
OL,16,Fcritics said it lacked detail and
OL,17,Fsubstance.
OL,26,@rD@HOUrD@dO]uD@SOUuD@`O]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G10/17
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,306,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30511
SC,0011
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1787093266
OL,3,CPM pledges to get thousands of rough
OL,4,Csleepers off the streets this Christmas
OL,6,FShelter chief executive Sarah Elliott
OL,7,Fdescribed the PM's pledge as a "game-
OL,8,Fchanging move and exactly the kind of
OL,9,Fbold leadership needed to end the
OL,10,Fhousing emergency".
OL,12,F"Tackling the most visible form of
OL,13,Fhomelessness is a strong start, but
OL,14,Fthe almost 178,000 children hidden
OL,15,Faway in grim temporary accommodation
OL,16,Falso need somewhere to call home," she
OL,17,Fadded.
OL,26,@oD@`OUrD@RO]tD@AOUxD@bO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G11/17
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,306,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30512
SC,0012
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1787093266
OL,3,CPM pledges to get thousands of rough
OL,4,Csleepers off the streets this Christmas
OL,6,F"The prime minister must apply the
OL,7,Fsame unwavering ambition to delivering
OL,8,Fthe council housing revolution he
OL,9,Fpromised."
OL,11,FCrossbench peer and co-founder of the
OL,12,FBig Issue, Lord John Bird, said:
OL,13,F"Covid proved that when we decide
OL,14,Frough sleeping is unacceptable, we can
OL,15,Fact and get people in off the streets.
OL,26,@nD@AOUqD@JO]uD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G12/17
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,306,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30513
SC,0013
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1787093266
OL,3,CPM pledges to get thousands of rough
OL,4,Csleepers off the streets this Christmas
OL,6,F"This Christmas commitment is a
OL,7,Fwelcome return to that spirit. But
OL,8,Fit's important that people are not
OL,9,Fjust brought in from the cold for a
OL,10,Ffew weeks, only to be sent back out
OL,11,Fagain.
OL,13,FCrisis chief executive Matt Downie
OL,14,Fadded: "Today's announcement
OL,15,Frepresents a clear statement that in
OL,16,Fthe 21st century, we will not tolerate
OL,17,Fa situation where people are having to
OL,18,Fbed down on our streets.
OL,26,@nD@AOUvD@HOU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G13/17
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,306,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30514
SC,0014
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1787093266
OL,3,CPM pledges to get thousands of rough
OL,4,Csleepers off the streets this Christmas
OL,6,F"It puts us on the path to an historic
OL,7,Fmilestone: the end of rough sleeping
OL,8,Fin England."
OL,10,F"Where access to a home isn't possible
OL,11,Fstraight away, providing good quality
OL,12,Faccommodation with a clear plan to
OL,13,Fsupport people into settled housing is
OL,14,Fa vital first step."
OL,16,FSubscribe free to our weekly
OL,17,Fnewsletter for exclusive and original
OL,18,Fcoverage from ITV News. Direct to your
OL,19,Finbox every Friday morning.
