OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G14/17
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,306,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30515
SC,0015
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1787093266
OL,3,CPM pledges to get thousands of rough
OL,4,Csleepers off the streets this Christmas
OL,6,FShadow housing secretary Sir James
OL,7,FCleverly said: "Andy Burnham promised
OL,8,Fto end rough sleeping in Manchester,
OL,9,Fand failed because he didn't do the
OL,10,Fhard work necessary.
OL,12,F"Now he is pledging to end it
OL,13,Fnationally without any plan for
OL,14,Fdelivery. And as with many of his
OL,15,Fother commitments, there is very
OL,16,Flittle detail on how this one will be
OL,17,Fpaid for."
OL,26,@oD@POUtD@AOUyD@JO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G15/17
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,306,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30516
SC,0016
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1787093266
OL,3,CPM pledges to get thousands of rough
OL,4,Csleepers off the streets this Christmas
OL,6,FHe added: "Labour must come clean on
OL,7,Fwhat other programmes they are cutting
OL,8,Fto pay for this project. Otherwise,
OL,9,Fstruggling families will fear that yet
OL,10,Fmore Labour tax rises are on the
OL,11,Fhorizon."
OL,13,FDeputy Reform UK leader Richard Tice
OL,14,Fdismissed the pledge as "yet another
OL,15,Fvague announcement with no substances
OL,16,Fwhich uses our most vulnerable for
OL,17,Fpolitical point-scoring".
OL,19,F"We'll believe it when we see it. Andy
OL,20,FBurnham's record on homelessness has
OL,21,Fleft a lot to be desired," he said.
OL,26,@nD@KOUsD@IO]vD@YOUyD@XO]{D@AOU}D@ZO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G16/17
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,306,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30517
SC,0017
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1787093266
OL,3,CPM pledges to get thousands of rough
OL,4,Csleepers off the streets this Christmas
OL,6,F"As mayor of Greater Manchester, he
OL,7,Fpromised to eradicate rough sleeping.
OL,8,FIn actual fact, homelessness in the
OL,9,Fcity-region increased every year since
OL,10,F2021."
OL,26,@nD@AOUrD@FO]
